Package: PhysioClinical
Type: Package
Title: Clinical Outcome Measures and Responder Analysis
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: person("Yusuke", "Matsui", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "mail.to.matsui@gmail.com")
Description: Validated clinical outcome-measure scoring (FMA, Berg, ARAT, TUG,
    6MWT, Barthel, Katz, Lawton-Brody IADL, ...), MDC/MCID responder
    classification, ICF tagging, interval (Rasch) analysis of ordinal ADL/IADL
    instruments, and normative deviation scoring for the x-biosignal
    rehabilitation ecosystem.
Depends: R (>= 4.2)
Imports:
    PhysioCore,
    methods,
    stats,
    utils,
    yaml
